# Warning-level gate. The disables below are deliberate, not oversights:
# the sand032/sand42 scripts drive spend-gated Modal campaigns, so these
# style findings are left unfixed rather than editing live operator tooling.
#   SC2034 unused vars (LOG/REPO/i are read by sourced or generated shells)
#   SC2155 declare-and-assign (exit status of the substitution is not used)
#   SC2206 intentional word-splitting when building argument arrays
disable=SC2034,SC2155,SC2206
